{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"11551","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11551","key":"MC-136147","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"16/Aug/18 7:15 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>When you throw a riptide trident in the offhand, you hit with the mainhand item instead. This means that throwing a riptide trident in the offhand while holding nothing in the mainhand will make the trident deal minimal damage. This also means that a sword held in the mainhand will inflict damage, apply most of its enchantments (looting is intended), and take durability damage when you ram into mobs via riptide trident in offhand.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Setup a scoreboard to count all damage dealt\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/scoreboard objectives add Damage minecraft.custom:minecraft.damage_dealt\n/scoreboard objectives setdisplay sidebar Damage\n/scoreboard players add @s Damage 0\n</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Get a trident with Riptide I and spawn an entity</li>\n\t<li>Throw the trident in mainhand<br>\n→ <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Score increases with 80</li>\n\t<li>Throw the trident in offhand while holding nothing in main hand<br>\n→ <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Score increases with 10</li>\n</ol>\n","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"03/Oct/18 9:14 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/13846","id":"13846","filename":"fixed.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"J Z","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Berlin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"18/Nov/24 7:44 AM","size":"9.02 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13846"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/13847","id":"13847","filename":"MC-136147.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/32"},"displayName":"Avoma","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/London","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"07/Jul/21 10:51 AM","size":"4.50 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/13847"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/13848","id":"13848","filename":"MC-136147 - Damage when holding trident in mai